omen came  forward it was crazy to think I was 13  years old on a set where I although all  the women around me were being really  really hurt and I was lucky to be  oblivious to to that but it's it was I  think such a big wake-up call of course  for all of us and and yes and I'm I'm  glad that there's consequences but  unfortunately I wish it just didn't  happen and and hopefully the  consequences will prevent and deter  other other people from abusing their  power and the conversation continues  Natalie Portman wonderful to have you in  years so much thank you for being here  and eating animals is in select theaters  today we have reached out to several  councils and associations in the meat  and farming industries and their  statements are posted on CBS this  morning calm
 

